  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "かげのなかに　ひそむことが　でき\nひとまえに　すがたを　みせないので\nそのそんざいは　まぼろし　だった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "그림자 안에 숨어 들을 수 있어\n사람들 앞에 모습을 보이지 않아\n그 존재는 환상이었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "可以潛入影子中，\n因為從不在人前現身，\n所以其存在曾被視為幻想。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dissimule son apparence aux autres en se\ntapissant dans l’ombre. Son existence pourrait\nse révéler n’être qu’une fable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da es sich im Schatten verbergen und so für\nmenschliche Augen unsichtbar werden kann,\nwar seine Existenz lange bezweifelt worden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido a que siempre se ha ocultado en las\nsombras y no le gusta dejarse ver, su misma\nexistencia es todo un misterio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nasconde nelle ombre per sfuggire alla vista\ndegli esseri viventi, e per questo si è dubitato\nper molto tempo della sua esistenza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Able to conceal itself in shadows, it never\nappears before humans, so its very existence\nwas the stuff of myth.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "影の中に　潜むことが　でき\n人前に　姿を　みせないので\nその存在は　幻　だった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "可以潜入影子中，\n因为不会在人的面前展露身姿，\n所以其存在曾是个幻想。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido a que siempre se ha ocultado en las\nsombras y no le gusta dejarse ver, su misma\nexistencia es todo un misterio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいての　かげに　もぐりこみ\nその　うごきや　ちからを　コピーする。\nおくびょうで　よわきな　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대의 그림자에 숨어들어\n그 움직임과 힘을 복사한다.\n겁이 많고 나약한 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會潛入對手的影子，\n複製其動作和力量。\n是種性格膽小而孱弱的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En se glissant dans l’ombre de son adversaire,\nil peut copier ses mouvements et ses forces.\nC’est un Pokémon au caractère timide et craintif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verschmilzt mit dem Schatten seiner Gegner\nund kopiert deren Bewegungen und Kräfte.\nEs ist ein feiges und schwaches Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se infiltra en la sombra de su oponente y copia\nsus movimientos y su fuerza. Es un Pokémon\ntímido y un poco cobardica.",
      "language": {
